      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 299.02,
      "end_seconds": 322.52,
      "duration_seconds": 23.5,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's allergic conjunctivitis and we'll watch how it goes. Avoid rubbing your eyes and keep windows closed on high-pollen days. Let's plan a check if not better in two weeks. How would you describe the plan so we're on the same page?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 324.19,
      "end_seconds": 331.05,
      "duration_seconds": 6.86,
      "text": "So I come back if not better in two weeks. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 334.84,
      "end_seconds": 339.39,
      "duration_seconds": 4.55,
      "text": "yes, exactly right that's all from me any questions?"
